    {
      "id": "p9-work-printshop.type-case",
      "title": "字盘里少了一个字母",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0216,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 18,
          "max": 60
        },
        {
          "kind": "employment",
          "employed": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "factory"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 60
        },
        {
          "key": "foreman",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 35,
          "maxAge": 65
        },
        {
          "key": "apprentice",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 14,
          "maxAge": 19
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "typesetting",
        "rush_order"
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "borrow-box",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把围裙一解，穿过街去对面印厂借一盒同号小写铅字，押了半克朗。回来时{foreman}已把广告标题排好，两人赶在午饭前上机印完五百份，油墨蹭了满手。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -0.5,
              "reason": "押给对面印厂的铅字保钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "craft",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "学会在急活里调配铅字"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$foreman",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "reason": "按时交活让工头信得过"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "borrow-box",
              "text": "街对面的印厂老板验过保钱，才让学徒捧出那只木盒；{subject}一路小跑回来，盒里的铅字哗啦响。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "borrow-box",
              "text": "午饭钟响时印刷机还在转，{foreman}拿手背擦额头，把印好的第一沓往柜台上一拍，说这才叫排字房。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "patch-smaller-type",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}用小一号的 e 填满空位，远处看还齐整，近看行距发虚。{foreman}翻了两页，扣了半天工钱，一克朗二十赫勒，说下回自己想法子。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1.2,
              "reason": "字距不齐被扣的半天工钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "被当众扣钱心里发闷"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "craft",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "记住字号不能混用"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "patch-smaller-type",
              "text": "{subject}把补上的字母一个个按平，指腹摸过去能觉出高低；广告主顾取货时没细看，工头却用指甲刮了刮行距。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "patch-smaller-type",
              "text": "工钱袋里少了几个硬币，{subject}数了两遍，把它塞回口袋，转身去收拾字盘，铅字碰得叮当响。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "apprentice-crawl",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}让{apprentice}趴在地上按字母把撒掉的铅字捡回格子，自己先排标题。活拖到下午三点才交，主顾骂了几句，学徒膝盖上全是灰。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "拖活挨骂的憋闷"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$apprentice",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "学徒觉得被当差使"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "craft",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "在缺字里练出排急活的手脚"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "apprentice-crawl",
              "text": "楼梯间的光线暗，{apprentice}把捡起的铅字按字母堆成小丘，{subject}在排字台前一根根补进去，指尖染得发黑。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "apprentice-crawl",
              "text": "下午的太阳移到窗框上，印刷机才咔嗒响起来；{foreman}在门口站了一会儿，什么也没说，只把交货单往前推了推。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
